    "text": "{\n  \"semantic_type\": \"flow\",\n  \"unit\": \"USD\",\n  \"additive_over_entities\": true,\n  \"additive_over_time\": false,\n  \"time_rollup\": \"reported_fy_value\",\n  \"valid_methods\": [\"sum_across_entities\", \"pct_change\"],\n  \"period_basis\": \"mixed\",\n  \"derivation\": \"Value of the us-gaap NetIncomeLoss XBRL fact as filed. The table holds discrete quarters (Q), year-to-date cumulatives (YTD6, YTD9) and full-year (FY) values for the same company. These periods overlap, so they must not be summed over time. Q4 is not filed as a 10-Q, so the fiscal-year figure comes from the 10-K FY value.\",\n  \"calendar\": \"fiscal\",\n  \"seasonal_adjustment\": \"NSA\",\n  \"annualized\": false,\n  \"entity_grain\": \"company (ticker/cik) per period_end and period_basis\",\n  \"hierarchy\": null,\n  \"comparability\": \"same_definition\",\n  \"lineage\": {\n    \"source\": \"SEC EDGAR XBRL companyfacts API\",\n    \"url\": null,\n    \"url_template\": \"https://data.sec.gov/api/xbrl/companyfacts/CIK{cik}.json\",\n    \"concept\": \"NetIncomeLoss\",\n    \"retrieved_on\": \"2026-10-24\"\n  },\n  \"description\": \"Net income (loss) in USD as reported in SEC 10-Q and 10-K filings, one row per company and reporting period. It is a flow measure. Filter to a single period_basis (Q, YTD6, YTD9 or FY) before aggregating. Sums across companies are valid only for the same period type and fiscal period, and companies' fiscal calendars differ.\"\n}",
